Turn that up, pretty boy.
That's my jam!

883
01:22:49.962 --> 01:22:51.231
Son of a bitch!

884
01:23:09.720 --> 01:23:12.062
This is good,
 this is good!

885
01:23:13.426 --> 01:23:14.555
Shut up!

886
01:23:43.986 --> 01:23:45.192
Son of a bitch.

887
01:23:54.240 --> 01:23:55.957
Seriously,
come on.

888
01:23:57.032 --> 01:23:58.435
Come on, Chase,
 you can you do this.

889
