1017
01:36:45.874 --> 01:36:48.247
No more daily shots.

1018
01:36:48.250 --> 01:36:49.829
No more human error.

1019
01:36:50.625 --> 01:36:53.449
No more tragedies like this one.

1020
01:36:53.504 --> 01:36:55.369
<i> - Is Phenotrans involved?
- Thank you. </i>

1021
01:36:59.176 --> 01:37:01.172
<i> - You use Zombrex every day?
- Every day. </i>

1022
