and you cost me my career.

1027
01:37:15.578 --> 01:37:16.960
Why would I be pissed?

1028
01:37:17.061 --> 01:37:18.560
I didn't lie.

1029
01:37:18.765 --> 01:37:20.850
I never sent you to that warehouse.

1030
01:37:20.874 --> 01:37:22.715
You put a note on my car.

1031
01:37:23.444 --> 01:37:25.030
No, I didn't.

1032
01:37:26.361 --> 01:37:28.217
Son of a bitch.

1033
01:37:28.319 --> 01:37:29.635
Lyons...

1034
01:37:29.820 --> 01:37:31.410
- He screwed us both.
- Yeah.

1035
01:37:31.445 --> 01:37:32.689
Me, more than you...

1036
01:37:32.713 --> 01:37:34.501
So what the hell is going on?

1037
01:37:35.076 --> 01:37:36.366
Okay, look...

1038
01:37:36.390 --> 01:37:39.071
Phenotrans came to us
years ago with these chips.

1039
01:37:39.095 --> 01:37:41.923
It was a civil rights nightmare,
obviously.

1040
01:37:41.999 --> 01:37:44.313
So we passed.
Now look what's happened.

1041
01:37:44.335 --> 01:37:47.078
The Army has been set up to
take over Homeland Defense.

1042
01:37:47.085 --> 01:37:49.778
Lyons is a frick'in hero.

1043
01:37:50.132 --> 01:37:53.396
and they can put these computer chips
in who ever they feel like.

1044
01:37:57.802 --> 01:37:59.326
How do I fix this?

1045
01:38:04.431 --> 01:38:05.579
Okay, look.

1046
01:38:05.682 --> 01:38:09.312
Does your kid have any
other information from the warehouse?

1047
01:38:10.479 --> 01:38:11.922
He's got pictures.

1048
01:38:15.646 --> 01:38:16.863
Wait a minute.

1049
01:38:20.069 --> 01:38:21.239
Check it out,

1050
01:38:22.404 --> 01:38:25.547
The Army already had those chips
on their trucks when they arrived.

1051
01:38:27.742 --> 01:38:29.749
That's not even the half of it.

1052
01:38:37.322 --> 01:38:38.422
It's okay.

1053
01:38:39.458 --> 01:38:40.557
Thanks.

1054
01:38:42.584 --> 01:38:43.464
Hey,

1055
01:38:43.836 --> 01:38:46.628
I'm leaving and I just thought
 maybe I could...

1056
01:38:46.652 --> 01:38:48.750
... get some closure on
Chase before I left.

1057
01:38:48.774 --> 01:38:50.112
I'm sorry about him.

1058
01:38:51.221 --> 01:38:52.389
Thanks.

1059
01:38:53.178 --> 01:38:55.684
Listen, can  I talk to the
officer who led that mission?

1060
01:38:55.708 --> 01:38:59.216
I think it would make me feel better
 knowing what he saw.

1061
01:38:59.725 --> 01:39:02.410
That off the books mission
I did it as a favor...

1062
01:39:03.350 --> 01:39:05.050
I'm sorry, I can't do that.

1063
01:39:05.894 --> 01:39:07.040
I know.

1064
01:39:07.186 --> 01:39:11.373
I'm just trying to make sure
I did everything I could,

1065
01:39:12.439 --> 01:39:14.520
But you said he did make
a difference and I think...

1066
01:39:15.278 --> 01:39:16.755
I think he would
 like that.

1067
01:39:17.405 --> 01:39:20.305
That line of survivors out there
proves that.

1068
01:39:20.989 --> 01:39:22.761
Let me add something personal.

1069
01:39:22.906 --> 01:39:25.905
I came here with orders
to wipe this place out.

1070
01:39:26.162 --> 01:39:27.446
But instead...

1071
01:39:27.954 --> 01:39:29.214
... my boys...

1072
01:39:29.620 --> 01:39:31.954
...are out there handing out blankets!

1073
01:39:31.978 --> 01:39:33.471
And hot meals.

1074
01:39:33.623 --> 01:39:36.310
Every one of them,
me in particular...

1075
01:39:36.334 --> 01:39:37.493
...owe that to him.

1076
01:39:38.335 --> 01:39:39.366
And you.

1077
01:39:42.297 --> 01:39:45.618
You've had enough time to get
the new chips here?

1078
01:39:45.832 --> 01:39:47.787
This is the US Army,
 darling.

1079
01:39:47.930 --> 01:39:50.759
When lives are on the line,
we move pretty damn fast.

1080
01:39:51.432 --> 01:39:52.931
That's a welcome change.

1081
01:39:52.933 --> 01:39:55.494
And Phenotrans, they can move up?

1082
01:39:55.598 --> 01:39:57.988
Well, they are not military,
they're not bad.

1083
01:39:58.355 --> 01:40:00.127
With three or four days warning.

1084
01:40:00.228 --> 01:40:01.620
They get the job done.

1085
01:40:02.896 --> 01:40:04.241
Three or four days?

1086
01:40:08.316 --> 01:40:09.493
Thanks.

1087
01:40:18.643 --> 01:40:20.293
<i> Survivors would
only need... </i>

1088
01:40:20.321 --> 01:40:22.748
<i> ... to refill the drug
once a year, </i>

1089
01:40:22.772 --> 01:40:25.364
<i> Would anyone who has this
disease not want that? </i>

1090
01:40:25.399 --> 01:40:26.804
<i> Maybe they wouldn't want to be tracked... </i>

1091
01:40:26.828 --> 01:40:27.900
<i> ... by the army 24/7. </i>

1092
01:40:28.324 --> 01:40:30.826
<i> Reading their vital signs,
tracking their movements. </i>

1093
01:40:31.160 --> 01:40:32.789
<i> You want the
Army to know... </i>

1094
01:40:32.813 --> 01:40:34.364
<i> ... every time you're
taking a dump, Sue? Come on! </i>

1095
01:40:34.388 --> 01:40:37.708
<i> The Army is not tracking
every time I take a dump, Frank. </i>

1096
01:40:37.732 --> 01:40:39.716
<i> - You don't know that.
- This is ridiculous. </i>

1097
01:40:39.878 --> 01:40:42.497
<i> The only thing they will be tracking... </i>

1098
01:40:42.521 --> 01:40:43.970
<i> ...is if you need more drugs, </i>

1099
01:40:43.994 --> 01:40:44.866
<i> - Really?
- Yes. </i>

1100
01:40:44.990 --> 01:40:45.904
<i> Yeah, I'm sure. </i>

1101
01:40:45.928 --> 01:40:47.057
<i> Because most people... </i>

1102
01:40:47.081 --> 01:40:48.039
<i> ... can't be trusted to remember... </i>

1103
01:40:48.063 --> 01:40:49.210
<i> ... when their life saving drug, </i>

1104
01:40:49.371 --> 01:40:50.277
<i> is about to run out. </i>

1105
01:40:50.435 --> 01:40:51.745
<i> But what if does more than that? </i>

1106
01:40:51.772 --> 01:40:53.346
<i> What if it listens to your
phone calls? </i>

1107
01:40:53.359 --> 01:40:56.250
<i> Knows who you're talking too,
knows what you are talking about? </i>

1108
01:40:56.488 --> 01:40:58.810
<i> - Knows if you're about to protest something,
- You're crazy. </i>

1109
01:40:58.834 --> 01:41:00.618
<i> What happens when they don't like
what you're doing, </i>

1110
01:41:00.699 --> 01:41:02.914
<i> come to your house in
a unmarked van... </i>

1111
01:41:02.938 --> 01:41:06.138
<i> throw you in the back and take you
to a secret base in Uzbekistan... </i>

1112
01:41:06.162 --> 01:41:09.210
<i> ... where they will hook up
electrodes to your ball sack... </i>

1113
01:41:10.127 --> 01:41:11.514
<i> ... and make you talk? </i>

1114
01:41:11.549 --> 01:41:13.120
<i> - Frank...
- That's a fact </i> ,

1115
01:41:13.144 --> 01:41:14.296
<i> - No
- Google it... </i>

1116
01:41:14.341 --> 01:41:17.812
<i> That's is simply, bat shit crazy. </i>

1117
01:41:17.836 --> 01:41:20.208
<i> Well, they've called me
that since Willamette. </i>

1118
01:41:20.432 --> 01:41:21.556
<i> But guess what? </i>

1119
01:41:21.562 --> 01:41:22.818
<i> I'm still here. </i>

1120
01:41:29.571 --> 01:41:32.984
We have Bravo team
guest estimate at one kilometer.

1121
01:41:33.008 --> 01:41:34.784
Make sure we have
some guys on roofs.

1122
01:41:34.808 --> 01:41:37.185
Okay, we have a lookout
in the northwest corner too.

1123
01:41:40.466 --> 01:41:41.306
Hey.

1124
01:41:41.756 --> 01:41:44.297
So, Phenotrans need
three or four days...

1125
01:41:44.760 --> 01:41:46.310
... to get those
chips to the military.

1126
01:41:47.008 --> 01:41:49.482
So, how did the bastards have
them when they arrived?

1127
01:41:49.506 --> 01:41:50.745
Exactly.

1128
01:41:50.765 --> 01:41:53.908
Wait, your friend
has got the FEZA waybill...

1129
01:41:53.943 --> 01:41:55.116
...straight to the warehouse.

1130
01:41:55.140 --> 01:41:56.728
But no one at FEZA
has heard of him.

1131
01:41:59.528 --> 01:42:01.472
Let's see if the military has.

1132
01:42:03.119 --> 01:42:04.684
Norton,
look at you.

1133
01:42:05.829 --> 01:42:07.615
Yeah,
show me that waybill.

1134
01:42:16.718 --> 01:42:18.653
Those fuckers!

1135
01:42:18.677 --> 01:42:20.301
The shipment came from Fort Carson.

1136
01:42:20.348 --> 01:42:21.718
That's General Lyons base.

1137
01:42:23.936 --> 01:42:26.166
Sit tight, The world got to see this.

1138
01:42:29.821 --> 01:42:30.624
Hey, wait...

1139
01:42:32.533 --> 01:42:34.202
No! No!
Please! Please!

1140
01:42:34.226 --> 01:42:35.445
Shit.

1141
01:42:42.920 --> 01:42:44.701
Tear it apart, if you have too.

1142
01:42:44.801 --> 01:42:46.118
Check everywhere.

1143
01:42:57.067 --> 01:42:58.164
Chase,

1144
01:42:58.652 --> 01:43:01.666
<i> the army planted
the bad Zombrex in there. </i>

1145
01:43:01.945 --> 01:43:05.271
So track the label of that case
you took the picture of.

1146
01:43:05.284 --> 01:43:07.064
If you can't find me,
it will lead to them.

1147
01:43:25.394 --> 01:43:27.806
Halt! Get down! Get down!

1148
01:43:27.899 --> 01:43:29.103
On the ground, now!

1149
01:43:29.446 --> 01:43:30.885
Check her out, check her!

1150
01:43:44.296 --> 01:43:46.656
<i> Leave your vehicle. </i>

1151
01:43:49.969 --> 01:43:53.169
<i> Walk towards the wall, slowly. </i>

1152
01:43:57.481 --> 01:44:00.088
<i> Keep your hands where
we can see them. </i>

1153
01:44:02.362 --> 01:44:03.510
They're not going to shoot us?

1154
01:44:04.572 --> 01:44:06.037
No, we're gonna be fine.

1155
01:44:15.463 --> 01:44:17.343
Oh, shit.
 Come on!

1156
01:44:28.523 --> 01:44:30.862
<i> Turn down the radio. </i>

1157
01:44:32.987 --> 01:44:34.369
I'm sorry, what?

1158
01:44:34.822 --> 01:44:37.863
<i> Turn off the radio now! </i>

1159
01:44:38.492 --> 01:44:39.732
Okay.

1160
01:44:44.419 --> 01:44:46.215
We need to see those hands.

1161
01:44:47.464 --> 01:44:49.796
<i> Your hands, let me see them. </i>

1162
01:44:53.180 --> 01:44:55.660
<i> Step away from the vehicle. </i>

1163
01:44:55.726 --> 01:44:57.819
- Is everything OK?
- Step away from the vehicle!

1164
01:44:57.924 --> 01:44:58.892
Yeah, Yeah.

1165
01:44:59.731 --> 01:45:02.411
<i> Step away from the vehicle, now! </i>

1166
01:45:02.443 --> 01:45:03.768
No problem!

1167
01:45:04.654 --> 01:45:06.051
No problem!

1168
01:45:21.636 --> 01:45:24.105
I lost the target!
I can't see!

1169
01:45:30.146 --> 01:45:33.221
Conserve your ammo,
wait for targets.

1170
01:45:39.788 --> 01:45:41.925
Come on,
boys and girls.

1171
01:46:02.773 --> 01:46:04.543
Welcome...

1172
01:46:04.569 --> 01:46:07.892
... to the after party,
to the party!

1173
01:46:15.417 --> 01:46:16.771
Is that's a fucking bomb?

1174
01:46:17.042 --> 01:46:18.188
Son of a bitch.

1175
01:46:23.297 --> 01:46:24.336
Go.

1176
01:46:44.704 --> 01:46:47.223
<i> - I think I see movement.
- Open fire! </i>

1177
01:48:25.050 --> 01:48:26.021
Come on!

1178
01:48:40.240 --> 01:48:41.236
Crystal!

1179
01:49:16.406 --> 01:49:17.258
Bomb!

1180
01:49:17.288 --> 01:49:19.584
- Bomb!
- Withdrawal!

1181
01:49:19.608 --> 01:49:21.288
Withdrawal!
Withdrawal!

1182
01:49:21.628 --> 01:49:22.609
Clear the area.

1183
01:49:26.882 --> 01:49:28.890
Crystal!
The bomb!

1184
01:49:30.428 --> 01:49:31.308
Go!

1185
01:49:51.960 --> 01:49:53.253
This is gonna hurt!

1186
01:50:19.037 --> 01:50:20.020
Run!

1187
01:51:02.139 --> 01:51:03.480
<i> Is this a secure line? </i>

1188
01:51:03.641 --> 01:51:04.761
Yes, sir,It is,

1189
01:51:05.019 --> 01:51:06.276
<i> You've done well, General.</i>

1190
01:51:06.520 --> 01:51:08.844
<i> Public pressure has worked
just as you predicted. </i>

1191
01:51:09.689 --> 01:51:12.503
I believe we have help
congress and the press...

1192
01:51:12.816 --> 01:51:14.415
... To better understand
their priorities, sir,

1193
01:51:15.280 --> 01:51:17.059
<i> I have the go order in my hand. </i>

1194
01:51:17.573 --> 01:51:19.027
<i> You have your green light, Lyons. </i>

1195
01:51:19.411 --> 01:51:20.748
Thank you, General Hemlock.

1196
01:51:30.799 --> 01:51:33.424
We are T minus five minutes.

1197
01:51:47.153 --> 01:51:48.025
You okay?

1198
01:51:49.199 --> 01:51:50.945
Yeah, are we done?

1199
01:51:50.950 --> 01:51:51.980
Almost.

1200
01:51:54.250 --> 01:51:55.627
Hey, you mind if I plug this in?

1201
01:51:56.211 --> 01:51:57.572
The battery is low.

1202
01:52:02.635 --> 01:52:06.131
Well, I guess you must
be pretty happy.

1203
01:52:06.890 --> 01:52:08.502
Finally got your big story.

1204
01:52:11.525 --> 01:52:13.068
I'm happy we got out alive.

1205
01:52:16.025 --> 01:52:16.946
Thank you,

1206
01:52:19.613 --> 01:52:20.701
Krabowski.

1207
01:52:32.966 --> 01:52:34.243
Sorry, I've gotta...

1208
01:52:35.218 --> 01:52:37.241
I haven't been able to find Jordan nowhere.

1209
01:52:37.390 --> 01:52:38.316
Yeah, Go.

1210
01:52:38.556 --> 01:52:39.719
I wanted to thank her.

1211
01:52:41.269 --> 01:52:42.371
I'll be right back.

1212
01:52:46.277 --> 01:52:47.694
This will only sting for a moment.

1213
01:52:50.746 --> 01:52:51.729
What?

1214
01:52:55.665 --> 01:52:58.686
And in three, two, one.

1215
01:53:00.166 --> 01:53:01.035
We're up.

1216
01:53:09.514 --> 01:53:10.446
Gentlemen,

1217
01:53:11.853 --> 01:53:13.478
Project Watchtower ...

1218
01:53:14.650 --> 01:53:15.721
...is now online.

1219
01:53:16.235 --> 01:53:17.344
Good job!

1220
01:53:17.471 --> 01:53:20.940
<i> Today, America breathes
a sigh of relief. </i>

1221
01:53:21.367 --> 01:53:22.650
<i> We survived.</i>

1222
01:53:22.909 --> 01:53:24.796
<i> And there is every reason to hope... </i>

1223
01:53:25.031 --> 01:53:28.407
<i> ... this is the last time
we will face such a crisis. </i>

1224
01:53:28.582 --> 01:53:30.510
<i> There is no reason
to believe that at all. </i>

1225
01:53:31.168 --> 01:53:32.844
<i> The zombie virus is out there... </i>

1226
01:53:33.379 --> 01:53:36.821
<i> ...waiting, resting,
rethinking it's strategy. </i>

1227
01:53:39.556 --> 01:53:40.732
<i> When it's ready, </i>

1228
01:53:41.268 --> 01:53:42.422
<i> it will be back.</i>

1229
01:53:43.437 --> 01:53:44.985
<i> All we can do is... </i>

1230
01:53:46.441 --> 01:53:47.888
<i> ... hope we are ready too. </i>

1231
01:53:50.488 --> 01:53:51.557
<i> Thank you, Frank. </i>

1232
01:53:53.451 --> 01:53:55.906
<i> Coming up next,
celebrity dogs. </i>

1233
01:53:56.918 --> 01:53:58.076
<i>Celebrity dogs. </i>

1234
01:54:01.504 --> 01:54:03.206
Come on, Jordan, pick up.

1235
01:54:51.220 --> 01:54:52.346
<i> Chase... </i>

1236
01:54:53.488 --> 01:54:55.344
<i> The army planted
bad Zombrex in there. </i>

1237
01:54:56.120 --> 01:54:58.597
<i> The tracking label on that crate
you took a picture of. </i>

1238
01:54:58.614 --> 01:55:00.407
<i> If you can't find me,
will lead you to them. </i>

1239
01:55:16.822 --> 01:55:19.504
- What's that?
- It's. ah...

1240
01:55:22.367 --> 01:55:23.514
Real news.

1241
01:55:36.834 --> 01:55:38.934
<i> Sky Captain, this is Zulu-2
approaching target. </i>

1242
01:55:39.045 --> 01:55:40.784
<i> Roger, Zulu-2,
 weapons are free. </i>

1243
01:55:40.943 --> 01:55:43.104
<i> Roger, Sky Captain,
starting the run now. </i>
